            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Left? (बायाँ, bāyā̃.) Straight? (सीधा, sīdhā.) Upside down? (उल्टा, ulṭā.) The middle? (बीच, bīc.) A corner? (कोना, konā.) Up? (ऊपर, ūpar.) Down? (नीचे, nīce.) Ahead? (आगे, āge.) Behind? (पीछे, pīche.) Inside? (अंदर, andar.) Half? (आधा, ādhā.) Whole? (पूरा, pūrā.) Double? (दुगना, dugnā.) Separate? (अलग, alag.) Round? (गोल, gol.) Square? (चौकोर, caukor.) Triangular? (तिकोना, tikoṇā.) Narrow? (संकरा, saṅkarā.) Shallow? (उथला, uthlā.) Stale? (बासी, bāsī.)"
